---
import SectionHeading from "../ui/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="shell">
    <SectionHeading index="02" label="About us" title="Building resilience. Engineering autonomy." headingId="about-heading" />
    <div class="about__body">
      <div class="about__manifesto" data-reveal>
        <span class="about__rule"></span>
        <p>Building secure foundations for next generation unmanned systems.</p>
        <div class="about__coordinates" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>CORE / 01</span><span>IND / UAV</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about__copy" data-reveal>
        <p>Increo is focused on developing the core technology stack that powers unmanned systems. We aim to rethink and engineer critical subsystems to deliver higher performance, reliability, and efficiency.</p>
        <p>Our mission is to build vertically integrated UAV subsystems, including flight control electronics and secure communication systems, reducing dependency on fragmented components while eliminating integration challenges.</p>
        <div class="about__focus" aria-label="Company focus">
          <div><span>01</span><strong>Core technology stack</strong></div>
          <div><span>02</span><strong>Vertically integrated subsystems</strong></div>
          <div><span>03</span><strong>Sovereign UAV technology</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
